            "notes": "Round 3! Hopefully your team is steamrolling and you guys have/are so close to getting that 10k delta. But if not, they don't worry! We'll get through this round. \n\n~95 HPS\n\nTARGET MONEY TO EARN THIS ROUND: $8000\n\nFor this round, I chose RENAISSANCE as my power. I think it's a good ability to have just incase you or you teammates slip up, it allows you to rez, quickly escape, and give your team a quick touch-up on heals or a bit extra damage boost to help turn the team fight into your favor. The primary item to buy is AMARI'S ANTIDOTE. It offers +25 health and 15% WEAPON POWER. As an additional bonus, you do an extra 15% WEAPON HEALING when your teammate is under half health. Honestly very good perk to have when you have multiple beam targets. \n\nAlternatively, you can buy BOOSTER JETS, which gives you 20% WEAPON SPEED, and grants an extra 10% movement speed after every time you use an ability (that lasts for 2 seconds). I do think this only applies to ground movement, however. GA's base cooldown is 1.5 seconds, but is extended to 3 seconds if you use a jump technique. Honestly, I do enjoy this item, but I do not recommend buying it first. I think AMARI'S ANTIDOTE is a stronger choice in supporting your team, but if you need that extra movement speed, this would be a find substitution.",
