            "notes": "Round 7! The score is tied, the stakes are high, your hands hurt, and you want this game to be over already!\n\n~125 HPS \n\nOur last power is quite honestly completely up to you. After they removed CREPUSUCLAR CIRCLE (RIP), I had to redo my entire build. My old Round 7 power was BATTLE MEDIC, but I honestly can't figure out the best power to substitute.\n\nI picked out 3 powers that complement the build nicely, and all have been good picks in games that got pushed all the way to Round 7. Pick between SUPPLY SURGE, TRIAGE UNIT, and PROTECTIVE BEAM. I highly suggest using SUPPLY SURGE, as it gives whoever is connected to the beam +20% MOVE SPEED, restores half their ammo (great for Ashe!), and reduces their cooldowns by 3 seconds. Honestly, this perk is great for quick boosts to push fights in your team's favor, and this could honestly be a great pick as a 3rd or 5h round power. Plus, it's only on a 10 second cooldown *AND* applies to *EVERYONE* connected to your beams (THREADS OF FATE, RENAISSANCE/VALK). \n\nNow for items, I *highly suggest* grabbing EYE OF THE SPIDER for that juicy +25% WEAPON POWER. If you have enough money for it, go for THE CLOSER for the+20% WEAPON POWER to max out the WP. \n\nIf you followed this build to its extent, you should be at 70% WP and 20% WS, which leaves you healing ~120 HPS. Good luck this round!",
